SUMMARY:Raw Cacao\, Sweet Remembrance: Honoring Our Untamable Soul
DESCRIPTION:Star Sounds Asheville\n**An All Souls Celebration**\n\nEvery v
 ersion of you that ever existed survived so that the current you could be 
 here today. Yet\, we rarely pause to honor the chapters we've outgrown\, t
 he dreams we've laid to rest\, or the younger selves who carried us throug
 h the dark.\nIn alignment with the veil-thinning energy of November 1st—
 traditionally a time for remembering ancestors—we invite you to a unique
 \, sacred ceremony dedicated to the archaeology of your own soul. This is 
 a ceremony not just to remember those who have passed\, but for rememberin
 g **the past versions of yourself.** Together\, we will honor our own hist
 ory\, offering deep gratitude\, and grief. We will celebrate the versions 
 of self that have supported our evolution as well as those that have come 
 before us!\n\n🌌 The Astrological Portal & The Rise of Lilith\nWe gather
  under a highly potent\, confrontational sky designed to strip away illusi
 ons and reveal your raw\, authentic truth. This All Soul’s Day is intens
 ified with the Moon\, Saturn\, and Lilith making a **Grand Trine** exactly
  as we meet. Ancestral healing and communication will be in the energetic 
 field.\n\n* 🔥 **The Wild Awakening of Black Moon Lilith:** Lilith is th
 e central heartbeat of this evening. She is the untamable\, raw\, and exil
 ed force within us. Lilith pulls our deepest shadows\, buried rages\, and 
 hidden shames into the light. Tonight\, we do not bypass or hide the "ugly
 " or messy versions of our past\; under Lilith's gaze\, we actively invite
  the outcast\, uninhibited\, and wild parts of our history back to the tab
 le to be reclaimed as pure medicine.\n* ☀️ **The Scorpio Sun:** The Su
 n illuminates our personal underworld\, giving us the immense courage requ
 ired to look directly at our old ghosts and forgotten shadows without blin
 king.\n* 🌗 **Third Quarter Moon in Leo:** This phase demands an emotion
 al exhale and a shedding of the past. In the sign of Leo\, it asks: *What 
 performance are you ready to stop playing? What mask are you ready to drop
 ?*\n* 🪐 **Saturn in Aries Retrograde:** Saturn oversees it all as the c
 osmic elder or the fierce enforcer. In retrograde and blazing through Arie
 s\, Saturn demands absolute self-honesty and personal sovereignty. It forc
 es us to take radical responsibility for our boundaries\, ensuring we lock
  in the hard-won wisdom of our past mistakes.\n* 🌋 **Pluto in Aquarius:
 ** Operating at a critical 1° after its 6 month retrograde\, Pluto acts a
 s a massive evolutionary engine ready to transform\, forcing a cellular re
 structuring so you can step into your future entirely unburdened.\n\n✨ T
 he Sacred Modalities\n\n* ☕ **Ceremonial Cacao:** We begin by drinking a
  heart-opening\, warm cacao elixir to ground our nervous systems\, quiet t
 he inner critic\, and safely open the emotional body to Scorpio's depths a
 nd Lilith's raw honesty.\n* ✍️ **The Shadow Dialogue & Radical Remembe
 rance:** Guided by the uninhibited spirit of Lilith and the strict honesty
  of Saturn\, you will speak directly to the parts of your history you were
  told were "too much\," misunderstood\, or cast out. Together\, we will in
 vite them in and offer them a place in our hearts.\n* 🌌 **Plutonian Sou
 nd Integration:** Wrap yourself in blankets and lay before the altar for a
  deeply restorative sound bath. Immersive crystal frequencies and resonant
  low tones will mirror Pluto's heavy\, transformative power and Lilith’s
  primal resonance—washing away residual grief\, releasing old timelines\
 , and anchoring your rebirth.\n\n**🙏Donations Start at $33 up to $55 Pl
 ease give what you can to guarantee your spot. If $33 is to much\, just em
 ail David at [david@starsounds.love](mailto:david@starsounds.love) for a s
 pecial price🙏**\n**Preferred register here:** [Star Sounds](https://www
 .starsounds.love/event-details/raw-cacao-sweet-remembrance-honoring-our-un
 tamable-soul) or Vemno @StarSounds (6690)\nIf you prefer to make it sponta
 neous\, you are welcome to show up and we will fill remaining spots on a f
 irst-come basis. See you there.\n\n🎒 What to Bring\n\n* A photograph of
  a loved one and/or a past version of yourself\, an old journal\, or a sma
 ll token/object representing a life chapter you are ready to honor and ful
 ly integrate.\n* A journal and pen.\n* A water bottle.\n* Comfortable clot
 hing for sitting and lying down.\n\n### **About Your Guides**\n\n**David H
 eiss** is an Evolutionary Astrologer\, Sound Alchemist & Sacred Ceremony F
 acilitator who specializes in Self-Discovery. He helps reveal each person
 ’s unique collection of stars and sound using a variety of insightful ch
 art readings\, sound journeys\, fire ceremonies\, and immersive experience
 s. David blends Gongs\, Crystal and Tibetan bowls\, plus many other mystic
 al instruments to cultivate conditions for healing and restoration. [https
 ://www.starsounds.love/](https://www.starsounds.love/)\n\n**Michelle** is 
 an avid SoulCollage® Creatrix and lifelong educator who knows we are a ne
 twork of connected humans. Michelle delights in nurturing and expanding id
 eas\, people\, and communities that are lighting up the world with their p
 recious energy. She works with individual’s HighSelves\, offering a wide
  range of tools and experiences\, to facilitate self-reflection and access
  to inner wisdom. Learn more [www.autumnhair.net](http://www.autumnhair.ne
 t).
